Imagine stocks fall sharply, your puts gain value, then stocks recover before expiry. The puts eventually expire worthless. Their terminal payoff alone wouldn\'92t capture the protection they provided during the selloff.\
There are 
\f1\b \strokec2 two distinct benefits
\f0\b0 \strokec2  to investigate:\
